# TerraPulse 3D works 100% out-of-the-box with ZERO API keys required
# (USGS Earthquakes, NASA EONET Disasters, Open-Meteo Weather/Marine/AirQuality, Sensor.Community).

# 1. Recommended for South Korea official real-time air quality (640+ AirKorea stations):
# Register free at https://www.data.go.kr -> "한국환경공단_에어코리아_대기오염정보"
# Accepts EITHER Encoding or Decoding service key automatically!
# DATA_GO_KR_API_KEY=

# 2. Optional for massive multi-instance traffic (Upstash Redis REST L2 distributed cache):
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# 3. Optional for North America / global PurpleAir sensor merge:
# PURPLEAIR_API_KEY=

# 4. Optional OpenWeather API key:
# OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=
